<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0B1220', padding: '20px 64px' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingBottom: 18 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF7' }}>一句话建提醒，只要三步</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.55, letterSpacing: 1 }}>不用填表单，不用学规则</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontFamily: 'Consolas', color: '#4FE0B0', opacity: 0.8 }}>核心演示</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 500, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 56, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', background: 'rgba(232,238,247,0.06)', border: '1px solid rgba(232,238,247,0.18)', borderRadius: 10 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E8EEF7' }}>只要说一句：「每周一三五下午三点半提醒我站起来活动，顺便锁屏」</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Box style={{ height: 260, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, background: 'rgba(79,224,176,0.05)', border: '2px dashed rgba(79,224,176,0.55)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 14px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontFamily: 'Consolas', color: '#4FE0B0', letterSpacing: 1 }}>截图 ⑤</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF7', textAlign: 'center' }}>智能体页 · 输入一句话</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.5, textAlign: 'center', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>建议画面：输入框里有这句话，<br />顶部的模式胶囊可见</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4FE0B0' }}>第一步 · 说一句话</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.65, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>时间、重复、要干什么说清楚就行，语序随便。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Box style={{ height: 260, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, background: 'rgba(79,224,176,0.05)', border: '2px dashed rgba(79,224,176,0.55)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 14px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontFamily: 'Consolas', color: '#4FE0B0', letterSpacing: 1 }}>截图 ⑥</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF7', textAlign: 'center' }}>智能体页 · 解析结果</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.5, textAlign: 'center', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>建议画面：列出 类型 / 时间 / 重复 / 系统操作，<br />并标注结果来源</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4FE0B0' }}>第二步 · 看结果</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.65, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>四个字段摊开摆在你面前，对不对一眼看得出。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Box style={{ height: 260, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, background: 'rgba(79,224,176,0.05)', border: '2px dashed rgba(79,224,176,0.55)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 14px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontFamily: 'Consolas', color: '#4FE0B0', letterSpacing: 1 }}>截图 ⑦</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF7', textAlign: 'center' }}>时间锚点页 · 已加入</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.5, textAlign: 'center', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>建议画面：列表顶部出现新锚点，<br />显示下次触发时间</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4FE0B0' }}>第三步 · 点一下加入</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.65, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>自动跳到锚点页，这条提醒已经能用了。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 56, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 20px', background: 'rgba(79,224,176,0.12)', border: '1px solid #4FE0B0', borderRadius: 10 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.9 }}>全程没填过一张表单——原来要点五六下、还得先学一套说法的事，现在说一句话就完了。</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.42 }}>知歇 ZhiXie · V1.0.0</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontFamily: 'Consolas', color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.42 }}>08 / 18</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
